#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:529 C/gnumeric.xml:727
msgid "The <quote><guilabel>Graphs &amp; Options</guilabel></quote> Tab"
msgstr "Fliken <quote><guilabel>Diagram och alternativ</guilabel></quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:531
msgid ""
"The <quote><guilabel>Graphs &amp; Options</guilabel></quote> tab allows "
"various options to be set. In the top half of the tab you can choose whether"
" you would like a graph to be created. If you choose to have a graph created"
" you can specify whether you would like to see a bar chart or a column "
"chart."
msgstr ""
"På fliken <quote><guilabel>Diagram och alternativ</guilabel></quote> kan du "
"ställa in olika alternativ. I den övre delen väljer du om ett diagram ska "
"skapas. Om du väljer det kan du ange om diagrammet ska visa staplar eller "
"kolumner."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:536
msgid ""
"In the bottom part of the tab you can select the "
"<quote><guilabel>percentages</guilabel></quote> option. This option replaces"
" the frequency counts with percentages."
msgstr ""
"I den nedre delen av fliken kan du välja "
"<quote><guilabel>procent</guilabel></quote>. Då visas frekvenserna i procent"
" i stället för som antal."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:540
msgid ""
"If the categories range contains repeated values, then the percentages may "
"add up to more than 100%. If the categories range does not contain all "
"values that occur in the input range, the percentages may sum to less than "
"100%."
msgstr ""
"Om kategorierna innehåller upprepade värden kan summan bli större än 100 %. "
"Om kategorierna inte omfattar alla värden i indataområdet kan summan bli "
"mindre än 100 %."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:544
msgid ""
"The <quote><guilabel>Use exact comparisons</guilabel></quote> checkbox "
"determines how category values and input range values are compared. If it is"
" checked then the function <function>EXACT</function> is used for the "
"comparison. If it isn't checked then simple equality is used. In this latter"
" case, empty cells and cells containing the numerical value 0 are considered"
" equal. As a consequence you usually want that checkbox to be selected."
msgstr ""
"Kryssrutan <quote><guilabel>Använd exakta jämförelser</guilabel></quote> "
"avgör hur kategorivärden jämförs med värdena i indataområdet. Om rutan är "
"markerad används funktionen <function>EXACT</function>. Annars används en "
"vanlig likhetsjämförelse, där tomma celler räknas som lika med celler som "
"innehåller talet 0. Därför bör rutan vanligtvis vara markerad."

