#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:590
msgid "Histogram Tool"
msgstr "Histogramverktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:596
msgid ""
"The histogram tool can be used to create histograms or frequency tables for "
"numerical data. Using this tool you can define intervals, or "
"<quote>bins</quote>. The tool determines how many data points belong to each"
" bin and presents this number numerically as well as graphically."
msgstr ""
"Histogramverktyget kan skapa histogram eller frekvenstabeller för numeriska "
"data. Med verktyget kan du definiera intervall, så kallade "
"<quote>klasser</quote>. Verktyget räknar hur många datapunkter som tillhör "
"varje klass och visar antalet både numeriskt och grafiskt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:602
msgid ""
"If your data are non-numeric this tool is not appropriate. In that case you "
"may want to use the frequency table tool described in section <xref "
"linkend=\"frequency-tool\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Verktyget passar inte för icke-numeriska data. Använd i så fall "
"frekvensverktyget som beskrivs i avsnittet <xref linkend=\"frequency-"
"tool\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:608
msgid "Histogram Tool Dialog"
msgstr "Dialogrutan för histogramverktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:610
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-histogram.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the dialog "
"to generate various histograms open to the \"Input\" tab.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-histogram.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Bild av dialogrutan för"
" att skapa histogram, med fliken Indata öppen.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:623
msgid ""
"As shown in <xref linkend=\"histogram-tool-dialog\"/>, the histogram dialog "
"has five tabs. We will introduce them in sequence."
msgstr ""
"Som visas i <xref linkend=\"histogram-tool-dialog\"/> har "
"histogramdialogrutan fem flikar. De presenteras i tur och ordning."
